main = draw h = Normal in fst (0, h == 1.0)
-- Task fuzz-unconsumed-vanyexcept-reaches-codegen. The observation says
-- nothing about `h == 1.0`: fst's inverse fills that slot with ANY, and the
-- tuple's snd handed the bare ANY to =='s inverse, whose condition it is. The
-- interpreter died on `if ANY`, and the inverse's VAnyExcept arm survived
-- into the emitted code, so neither text backend compiled the program. A step
-- handed a wildcard the chain made up now recovers a wildcard, which leaves
-- `h` unconstrained: p(0) = 1.
